    ,                         !- Window Glass Spectral Data Set Name
    0.02,                     !- Thickness
    0.75,                     !- Solar Transmittance at Normal Incidence
    0.075,                    !- Front Side Solar Reflectance at Normal Incidence
    0.075,                    !- Back Side Solar Reflectance at Normal Incidence
